flowchart TD
    A([Canonical Markdown file])
    B[read_markdown_document]
    C[Validate YAML metadata<br/>and Markdown body]
    T{Index eligible?<br/>ocr_status = done AND<br/>review_status = approved}
    U([Not eligible<br/>stop before chunk/index<br/>request OCR or review])
    D[chunk_markdown_body]
    E[ChunkingResult<br/>parents + children + warnings + errors]
    F{errors present?}
    G[Mark ingestion failed<br/>persist error details]
    H{strict mode and<br/>warnings present?}
    I[Stop before publish<br/>request review]
    J[Preview chunks and warnings]
    K[PostgreSQL transaction<br/>replace Parent/Child chunks<br/>canonical content + parent relations]
    L{publish?}
    M([IngestionResult publish=false<br/>chunks saved, no Qdrant upsert])
    N[Build embedding text<br/>for Child chunks only]
    O[Embed Child chunks]
    P[Build Qdrant payload<br/>Chunk.metadata structural fields<br/>+ PostgreSQL IDs]
    Q[Upsert deterministic points]
    R[Update chunk index_status = indexed<br/>and version rag_status = published]
    S([Published for retrieval])

    A --> B --> C --> T
    T -->|no| U
    T -->|yes| D --> E --> F
    F -->|yes| G
    F -->|no| H
    H -->|yes| I
    H -->|no| J --> K --> L
    L -->|false| M
    L -->|true| N --> O --> P --> Q --> R --> S

    E -. warnings do not block<br/>in default mode .-> J
    B -. exception .-> G
    C -. exception .-> G
    D -. exception .-> G
    K -. exception .-> G
    O -. exception .-> G
    Q -. exception .-> G

    subgraph Orchestrator_only
        B
        T
        D
        K
        O
        Q
    end
